<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>星尘观测站 | Stellar Observatory</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  
  :root {
    --bg-primary: #0B1026;
    --bg-secondary: #111838;
    --accent-blue: #4FC3F7;
    --accent-purple: #9C27B0;
    --accent-orange: #FF9800;
    --text-white: #FFFFFF;
    --text-gray: #B0B8D1;
    --card-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    --card-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    color: var(--text-white);
    line-height: 1.7;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* 星空背景 */
  #starfield {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0;
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* 导航栏 */
  .navbar {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    padding: 16px 40px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    background: rgba(11, 16, 38, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .logo {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-blue), var(--accent-purple));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    color: var(--text-gray);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 15px;
    transition: color 0.3s;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover,
  .nav-links a.active {
    color: var(--accent-blue);
  }

  .mobile-menu-btn {
    display: none;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: white;
    font-size: 24px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* 主内容区 */
  .main-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    padding-top: 70px;
  }

  .page {
    display: none;
    min-height: 100vh;
    animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease;
  }

  .page.active { display: block; }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  /* 首页 Hero */
  .hero {
    height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    background: 
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(11,16,38,0.3) 0%, rgba(11,16,38,0.95) 100%),
      url('https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/STSCI-H-p1851a-6149x5736/STSCI-H-p1851a-6149x5736~medium.jpg') center/cover no-repeat;
  }

  .hero-content {
    max-width: 800px;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(79, 195, 247, 0.3);
  }

  .hero .subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 20px);
    color: var(--text-gray);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .hero-tagline {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .scroll-hint {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 40px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    color: var(--text-gray);
    font-size: 14px;
    animation: bounce 2s infinite;
  }

  @keyframes bounce {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(10px); }
  }

  /* 通用区块 */
  .section {
    padding: 80px 40px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-desc {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-gray);
    margin-bottom: 50px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  /* 导航卡片 */
  .nav-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .nav-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px 24px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .nav-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    border-color: var(--accent-blue);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(79, 195, 247, 0.15);
  }

  .nav-card .icon {
    font-size: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .nav-card h3 {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .nav-card p {
    color: var(--text-gray);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .nav-card.blue:hover { border-color: var(--accent-blue); }
  .nav-card.purple:hover { border-color: var(--accent-purple); }
  .nav-card.orange:hover { border-color: var(--accent-orange); }

  /* 最新更新 */
  .updates-list {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .update-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }

  .update-date {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    min-width: 80px;
  }

  .update-content h4 {
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .update-content p {
    color: var(--text-gray);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  /* 项目简介 */
  .intro-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .intro-text h3 {
    font-size: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .intro-text p {
    color: var(--text-gray);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .intro-image {
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  }

  .intro-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 300px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  /* 文章分类标签 */
  .category-tabs {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .tab-btn {
    padding: 10px 24px;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: 30px;
    color: var(--text-gray);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 14px;
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }

  .tab-btn:hover,
  .tab-btn.active {
    background: rgba(79, 195, 247, 0.15);
    border-color: var(--accent-blue);
    color: var(--accent-blue);
  }

  /* 文章卡片网格 */
  .articles-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .article-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .article-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    border-color: var(--accent-blue);
  }

  .article-cover {
    height: 180px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .article-cover img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.5s;
  }

  .article-card:hover .article-cover img {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .article-body {
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .article-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    background: rgba(79, 195, 247, 0.15);
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .article-body h3 {
    font-size: 17px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .article-body p {
    color: var(--text-gray);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* 研究页面 */
  .research-section {
    margin-bottom: 70px;
  }

  .research-section h2 {
    font-size: 26px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .research-section h2::before {
    content: '';
    width: 4px;
    height: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--accent-blue), var(--accent-purple));
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  /* 观测日志时间线 */
  .timeline {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 30px;
  }

  .timeline::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 8px;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--accent-blue), var(--accent-purple));
  }

  .timeline-item {
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    padding: 20px;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  }

  .timeline-item::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -26px;
    top: 24px;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    background: var(--accent-blue);
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 3px solid var(--bg-primary);
  }

  .timeline-date {
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .timeline-item h4 {
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .timeline-item p {
    color: var(--text-gray);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  /* 研究报告卡片 */
  .report-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(340px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .report-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px;
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }

  .report-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent-purple);
    background: rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.05);
  }

  .report-card .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    background: rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.2);
    color: #CE93D8;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .report-card h4 {
    font-size: 17px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .report-card p {
    color: var(--text-gray);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .report-card .read-more {
    color: var(--accent-purple);
    font-size: 13px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  /* 数据可视化 */
  .chart-container {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .chart-container h4 {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .chart-placeholder {
    height: 280px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--text-gray);
    font-size: 14px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* 简易散点图模拟 */
  .scatter-chart {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    position: relative;
  }

  .scatter-dot {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  /* 读书笔记 */
  .book-notes {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .book-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .book-card h4 {
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .book-card .author {
    color: var(--text-gray);
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .book-card .rating {
    color: var(--accent-orange);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .book-card .note {
    color: var(--text-gray);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* 资源页面 */
  .resource-category {
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .resource-category h2 {
    font-size: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .resource-category h2 .icon {
    font-size: 28px;
  }

  .resource-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .resource-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px;
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }

  .resource-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent-orange);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .resource-card h4 {
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .resource-card .meta {
    color: var(--accent-orange);
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .resource-card p {
    color: var(--text-gray);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  /* 望远镜指南 */
  .telescope-guide {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 30px;
  }

  .tier {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }

  .tier:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .tier h4 {
    color: var(--accent-orange);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .tier ul {
    list-style: none;
    color: var(--text-gray);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .tier li {
    padding: 4px 0;
    padding-left: 16px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .tier li::before {
    content: '✦';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent-orange);
  }

  /* 页脚 */
  .footer {
    padding: 40px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-gray);
    font-size: 13px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* 响应式 */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .navbar { padding: 14px 20px; }
    .nav-links { display: none; }
    .nav-links.mobile-open {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      position: absolute;
      top: 100%;
      left: 0; right: 0;
      background: rgba(11, 16, 38, 0.95);
      padding: 20px;
      gap: 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }
    .mobile-menu-btn { display: block; }
    
    .section { padding: 50px 20px; }
    .nav-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .intro-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .section-title { font-size: 24px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- 星空粒子背景 -->
<canvas id="starfield"></canvas>

<!-- 导航栏 -->
<nav class="navbar">
  <div class="logo">✦ 星尘观测站</div>
  <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
    <li><a class="nav-link active" data-page="home">首页</a></li>
    <li><a class="nav-link" data-page="articles">科普文章</a></li>
    <li><a class="nav-link" data-page="research">个人研究</a></li>
    <li><a class="nav-link" data-page="resources">资源推荐</a></li>
  </ul>
  <button class="mobile-menu-btn" onclick="toggleMenu()">☰</button>
</nav>

<!-- 主内容 -->
<div class="main-content">

  <!-- 首页 -->
  <div class="page active" id="page-home">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>探索宇宙的边界</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">记录天文观测 · 分享科普知识 · 展现研究热情</p>
        <p class="hero-tagline">"我们都是星尘的产物，仰望星空便是回望故乡"</p>
      </div>
      <div class="scroll-hint">↓ 向下探索</div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">探索宇宙的入口</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">从科普知识到深度研究，从入门资源到观测记录</p>
      <div class="nav-cards">
        <div class="nav-card blue" onclick="goToPage('articles')">
          <div class="icon">📚</div>
          <h3>科普文章</h3>
          <p>太阳系漫游 · 恒星一生 · 星系宇宙 · 未解之谜</p>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-card purple" onclick="goToPage('research')">
          <div class="icon">🔬</div>
          <h3>个人研究</h3>
          <p>观测日志 · 研究报告 · 数据可视化 · 读书笔记</p>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-card orange" onclick="goToPage('resources')">
          <div class="icon">📖</div>
          <h3>资源推荐</h3>
          <p>入门书籍 · 纪录片 · 望远镜选购指南</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);">
      <h2 class="section-title">最新更新</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">记录每一次与星空的相遇</p>
      <div class="updates-list">
        <div class="update-item">
          <div class="update-date">2026.11.05</div>
          <div class="update-content">
            <h4>完成系外行星探测方法研究报告</h4>
            <p>整理了凌日法、径向速度法、直接成像法等五种主流探测技术的原理与最新进展</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="update-item">
          <div class="update-date">2026.10.28</div>
          <div class="update-content">
            <h4>猎户座大星云观测记录</h4>
            <p>使用8寸牛顿反射镜成功观测M42，记录星云纹理与四合星区域细节</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="update-item">
          <div class="update-date">2026.10.15</div>
          <div class="update-content">
            <h4>新增恒星演化数据可视化</h4>
            <p>用Python绘制了赫罗图与恒星质量-寿命关系曲线</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="update-item">
          <div class="update-date">2026.09.20</div>
          <div class="update-content">
            <h4>《时间简史》读书笔记更新</h4>
            <p>完成黑洞热力学与霍金辐射章节的深度阅读笔记</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="intro-grid">
        <div class="intro-text">
          <h3>关于这个项目</h3>
          <p>这是一个由天文爱好者独立运营的科普与研究记录平台。我相信宇宙的奥秘值得被更多人看见，也希望用自己的探索历程感染同样热爱星空的同龄人。</p>
          <p>从入门级的天文科普，到专业级的观测记录与数据分析，这里记录了我在天文学道路上的每一步成长。</p>
          <p>如果你是大学招生官，希望这个网站能让你看到我对天体物理的真诚热爱与持续投入；如果你是同好，欢迎一起交流探讨。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="intro-image">
          <img src="https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/PIA12068/PIA12068~medium.jpg" alt="宇宙深空" loading="lazy">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- 科普文章页 -->
  <div class="page" id="page-articles">
    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">科普文章</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">用通俗的语言，讲好宇宙的故事</p>
      
      <div class="category-tabs">
        <button class="tab-btn active" data-cat="all">全部</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" data-cat="solar">太阳系漫游</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" data-cat="stars">恒星一生</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" data-cat="galaxy">星系宇宙</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" data-cat="mystery">未解之谜</button>
      </div>

      <div class="articles-grid" id="articlesGrid">
